{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Without cause</b> — The meaning: for I have not transgressed, and I have no sin or iniquity, on account of which they would run to take vengeance against me." "And the meaning of <b>Arouse Yourself</b> — corresponding to \"and they watched the house.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 59, :notes {0 "The lemma בלי corresponds to למה תשוב אלי בלי in Psalms 59:5; translated as its sense requires."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:13.169141372Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}